flowchart TD
    A[Alert / acceptance failure] --> B[Stop admission and capture evidence]
    B --> C{Correctness or isolation risk?}
    C -- Yes --> D[Disable all persistent reads/writes]
    C -- No, write/storage only --> E[Open write circuit / read-only]
    D --> F[Snapshot or rename persistent root]
    E --> F
    F --> G[Restart current binary in ephemeral/off mode]
    G --> H{Service healthy and cold path correct?}
    H -- Yes --> I[Preserve store; investigate offline]
    H -- No --> J[Deploy previous release]
    J --> K[Ensure previous binary cannot access newer store]
    K --> I
    I --> L[Regression test + lane fix]
    L --> M[Read-only canary before re-enable]
